[SIZE="4"][B]How it was made[/B][/SIZE]

The ZIP is generated from the TWRP backup by [URL="https://github.com/chijure-android-system-development/android_device_huawei_y220"]tools/make-stock-zip.py[/URL] in the Y220 device tree. It reads the backup tar directly, so owners, modes and symlinks are taken as they are, and uses the same installer as the CyanogenMod 7 ZIP for this phone (UBIFS-aware, boot written with TWRP's flash_image).

